   "text": "States: PENDING_DEPOSIT > PROCESSING > SETTLED | REFUNDED | EXPIRED | LATE_DEPOSIT > REFUNDED\nDelivery: signed webhook per session, or onTendrDeposit hook. Addresses are one-time per session.\nOps: secrets in KMS, logs + metrics + alerts, status page. We never store merchant full-access keys",
